Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 11:06:41 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 222/260] [ae-patch] Make the limit hover card readable by
 screen readers, safe to tap, and honest about stale windows

Review findings on the hover card: the icon button announces its expanded state and the card is a labelled region; a touch opens or closes on pointer-up so a cancelled touchstart cannot swallow the tap, and a second tap closes it; windows whose reset has passed are left out; bar colour follows the raw reading the gate compares.
